<title>MALAYSIA: Hume Industries 6-mth net up 28 pct.</title>
<headline>Hume Industries 6-mth net up 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	27.7    vs	21.7</p>
<p>    Net profit		  68.61   vs	53.76</p>
<p>    Turnover		 2,007.54   vs   1,873.69</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   139.26   vs     123.54</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less   31.89   vs less 25.38</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  add   132.43   vs less  7.02</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	   9.0    vs	 8.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Hume Industries (Malaysia) Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
